 "title": "四种重入",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 176.48,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "接下来，按调用栈，一种一种看。",
   "spoken": "接下来，按掉用栈，一种一种看。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.864,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.626
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "第一种，单函数重入。",
   "spoken": "第一种，单函数虫入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.684,
   "dur": 2.808,
   "speechStart": 5.782,
   "speechEnd": 7.651
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "漏洞版的取款函数，分三步：读余额，转账，清零。",
   "spoken": "漏洞版的取款函数，分三步：读余额，转账，清零。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-02.mp3",
   "start": 8.712,
   "dur": 5.856,
   "speechStart": 8.81,
   "speechEnd": 13.738
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "攻击者调用取款。银行读到余额 1 个 ETH，用 call 把钱转过去。",
   "spoken": "攻击者掉用取款。银航读到余额 1 个 ETH，用 call 把钱转过去。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-03.mp3",
   "start": 14.788,
   "dur": 6.216,
   "speechStart": 14.886,
   "speechEnd": 20.181
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "攻击合约的 receive 被触发。银行还有钱，它就再调用一次取款。",
   "spoken": "攻击合约的 receive 被触发。银航还有钱，它就再掉用一次取款。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-04.mp3",
   "start": 21.224,
   "dur": 6.144,
   "speechStart": 21.322,
   "speechEnd": 26.534
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "第二层读到的余额，还是 1 个。因为第一层的清零，还没执行。",
   "spoken": "第二层读到的余额，还是 1 个。因为第一层的清零，还没执行。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 27.588,
   "dur": 6.048,
   "speechStart": 27.686,
   "speechEnd": 32.802
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "一层套一层，直到金库余额不够，递归才停下来。",
   "spoken": "一层套一层，直到金库余额不够，递归才停下来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 33.856,
   "dur": 4.752,
   "speechStart": 33.954,
   "speechEnd": 37.763
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "然后各层依次返回，依次清零。这时钱已经没了。",
   "spoken": "然后各层依次返回，依次清零。这时钱已经没了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-07.mp3",
   "start": 38.828,
   "dur": 5.136,
   "speechStart": 38.926,
   "speechEnd": 43.138
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "递归有上限。gas 和调用深度 1024，都会限制它。所以攻击者会每次取尽量大的金额，减少层数。",
   "spoken": "递归有上限。gas 和掉用深度 1024，都会限制它。所以攻击者会每次取尽量大的金额，减少层数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-08.mp3",
   "start": 44.184,
   "dur": 10.32,
   "speechStart": 44.282,
   "speechEnd": 53.66
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "第二种，跨函数重入。",
   "spoken": "第二种，跨函数虫入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-09.mp3",
   "start": 54.724,
   "dur": 2.832,
   "speechStart": 54.822,
   "speechEnd": 56.726
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "攻击者不回到取款函数，而是进入另一个共享同一份余额的函数，比如转账。",
   "spoken": "攻击者不回到取款函数，而是进入另一个共享同一份余额的函数，比如转账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-10.mp3",
   "start": 57.776,
   "dur": 6.408,
   "speechStart": 57.874,
   "speechEnd": 63.35
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "取款加了重入锁，转账没加。攻击者还能利用回调吗？",
   "spoken": "取款加了虫入锁，转账没加。攻击者还能利用回掉吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-11.mp3",
   "start": 64.404,
   "dur": 5.472,
   "speechStart": 64.502,
   "speechEnd": 69.035
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "能。锁只拦截进入被锁函数的调用。",
   "spoken": "能。锁只拦截进入被锁函数的掉用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-12.mp3",
   "start": 70.376,
   "dur": 4.224,
   "speechStart": 70.474,
   "speechEnd": 73.769
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "在回调里，攻击者把还没清零的余额，转给同伙。外层返回之后，才清零。",
   "spoken": "在回掉里，攻击者把还没清零的余额，转给同伙。外层返回之后，才清零。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-13.mp3",
   "start": 74.82,
   "dur": 7.344,
   "speechStart": 74.918,
   "speechEnd": 81.332
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "同一笔钱，既被提走了，又被转走了。",
   "spoken": "同一笔钱，既被提走了，又被转走了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-14.mp3",
   "start": 82.384,
   "dur": 4.008,
   "speechStart": 82.482,
   "speechEnd": 85.553
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "2022 年 4 月的 Fei Rari，就是它的真实版本，损失约 8000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2022 年 4 月的 Fei Rari，就是它的真实版本，损失约 8000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-15.mp3",
   "start": 86.612,
   "dur": 6.096,
   "speechStart": 86.71,
   "speechEnd": 91.864
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "借款函数先用 call 发送 ETH，后写借款记录。",
   "spoken": "借款函数先用 call 发送 ETH，后写借款记录。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-16.mp3",
   "start": 92.928,
   "dur": 4.656,
   "speechStart": 93.026,
   "speechEnd": 96.752
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "攻击者在回调里，调用了没有被锁覆盖的退出市场函数，取回了全部抵押品。",
   "spoken": "攻击者在回掉里，掉用了没有被锁覆盖的退出市场函数，取回了全部抵押品。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-17.mp3",
   "start": 97.804,
   "dur": 6.528,
   "speechStart": 97.902,
   "speechEnd": 103.497
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "第三种，跨合约重入。",
   "spoken": "第三种，跨合约虫入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-18.mp3",
   "start": 104.552,
   "dur": 2.976,
   "speechStart": 104.65,
   "speechEnd": 106.697
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "协议由多个合约组成，比如金库合约和份额代币合约，它们共享状态。",
   "spoken": "协议由多个合约组成，比如金库合约和份额代币合约，它们共享状态。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-19.mp3",
   "start": 107.748,
   "dur": 6.672,
   "speechStart": 107.846,
   "speechEnd": 113.584
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "合约 A 的锁，挡不住对合约 B 的调用。B 此刻读到的，是 A 还没更新的状态。",
   "spoken": "合约 A 的锁，挡不住对合约 B 的掉用。B 此刻读到的，是 A 还没更新的状态。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-20.mp3",
   "start": 114.64,
   "dur": 7.32,
   "speechStart": 114.738,
   "speechEnd": 121.104
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-21",
   "text": "第四种，只读重入，最隐蔽。",
   "spoken": "第四种，只读虫入，最隐蔽。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-21.mp3",
   "start": 122.18,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 122.278,
   "speechEnd": 124.968
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-22",
   "text": "攻击者在回调里不修改目标合约，而是让第三方协议去读它。",
   "spoken": "攻击者在回掉里不修改目标合约，而是让第三方协议去读它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-22.mp3",
   "start": 126.0,
   "dur": 5.712,
   "speechStart": 126.098,
   "speechEnd": 130.883
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-23",
   "text": "比如一个 AMM 池，移除流动性时，先转出代币，后更新总量。",
   "spoken": "比如一个 AMM 池，移除流动性时，先转出代币，后更新总量。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-23.mp3",
   "start": 131.932,
   "dur": 5.808,
   "speechStart": 132.03,
   "speechEnd": 136.887
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-24",
   "text": "在回调的那一刻，储备已经减少，总量还没减少。",
   "spoken": "在回掉的那一刻，储备已经减少，总量还没减少。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-24.mp3",
   "start": 137.96,
   "dur": 4.824,
   "speechStart": 138.058,
   "speechEnd": 141.939
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-25",
   "text": "这时借贷协议来读池子的价格函数，读到一个被扭曲的价格，再按它放贷或清算。",
   "spoken": "这时借贷协议来读池子的价格函数，读到一个被扭曲的价格，再按它放贷或清算。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-25.mp3",
   "start": 143.004,
   "dur": 7.44,
   "speechStart": 143.102,
   "speechEnd": 149.602
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-26",
   "text": "池子自己的状态，最终是对的。出错的，是在中间时刻读数据的第三方。",
   "spoken": "池子自己的状态，最终是对的。出错的，是在中间时刻读数据的第三方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-26.mp3",
   "start": 150.664,
   "dur": 7.416,
   "speechStart": 150.762,
   "speechEnd": 157.259
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-27",
   "text": "池子的 view 函数通常不加锁，所以重入锁挡不住。",
   "spoken": "池子的 view 函数通常不加锁，所以虫入锁挡不住。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-27.mp3",
   "start": 158.3,
   "dur": 5.304,
   "speechStart": 158.398,
   "speechEnd": 162.767
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-28",
   "text": "2023 年 2 月的 dForce，就是这样，损失约 360 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 2 月的 dForce，就是这样，损失约 360 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-28.mp3",
   "start": 163.824,
   "dur": 5.736,
   "speechStart": 163.922,
   "speechEnd": 168.707
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-29",
   "text": "它用 Curve 池在回调期间返回的虚拟价格，给抵押品定价。",
   "spoken": "它用 Curve 池在回掉期间返回的虚拟价格，给抵押品定价。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg3-29.mp3",
